sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend as Frontend<br/>(HTML/JS)
    participant MetaMask
    participant MerchantSigner as Merchant Signer<br/>(Off-chain)
    participant SmartContract as LoyaltyRewardsToken<br/>(Smart Contract)
    participant Blockchain as Ethereum<br/>Blockchain

    Note over User, Blockchain: Application Initialization Phase
    User->>Frontend: Opens DApp in browser
    Frontend->>Frontend: Load contract ABI from abi.json
    Frontend->>Frontend: Load contract address from deployment-info.json
    Frontend->>User: Display UI with Connect Wallet button

    Note over User, Blockchain: Wallet Connection Phase
    User->>Frontend: Clicks "Connect MetaMask"
    Frontend->>MetaMask: Request wallet connection
    MetaMask->>User: Show connection prompt
    User->>MetaMask: Approve connection
    MetaMask->>Frontend: Return user address
    Frontend->>Frontend: Initialize contract instance
    Frontend->>User: Display "Connected: [address]"

    Note over User, Blockchain: Reward Redemption Phase
    User->>Frontend: Clicks "Redeem Basic/Premium Reward"
    Frontend->>Frontend: Generate unique actionId<br/>(tier + address + timestamp + random)
    Frontend->>Frontend: Create message hash<br/>keccak256(actionId, userAddress)
    
    Note over Frontend, MerchantSigner: Digital Signature Generation
    Frontend->>MerchantSigner: Sign message hash with merchant private key
    MerchantSigner->>Frontend: Return signature

    Note over User, Blockchain: Smart Contract Interaction
    Frontend->>SmartContract: Call redeemTicket(actionId, signature, tier)
    
    Note over SmartContract: Signature Verification
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Recover signer from signature
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Verify signer == merchantSigner
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Check if ticket not already used
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Validate tier ("basic" or "premium")
    
    alt Valid Signature & Unused Ticket
        SmartContract->>SmartContract: Mark ticket as used
        SmartContract->>SmartContract: Generate new tokenId
        SmartContract->>SmartContract: Store token tier mapping
        SmartContract->>SmartContract: Mint NFT to user address
        SmartContract->>Blockchain: Emit TicketRedeemed event
        SmartContract->>Frontend: Return transaction receipt
        
        Note over Frontend: Success Display
        Frontend->>SmartContract: Query tokenURI(tokenId)
        SmartContract->>Frontend: Return image URL (tier-based)
        Frontend->>User: Display success message with:<br/>• Contract address<br/>• Token ID<br/>• Tier<br/>• Transaction hash<br/>• NFT image
        
    else Invalid Signature or Used Ticket
        SmartContract->>Frontend: Revert with error message
        Frontend->>User: Display error message
    end

    Note over User, Blockchain: Optional: View Token Information
    opt User wants to view their tokens
        Frontend->>SmartContract: Call getUserTokensWithTiers(userAddress)
        SmartContract->>Frontend: Return array of tokenIds and tiers
        Frontend->>User: Display user's NFT collection
    end

    Note over User, Blockchain: Contract Statistics
    opt View statistics
        Frontend->>SmartContract: Call getTotalSupply()
        Frontend->>SmartContract: Call getBasicTokenCount()
        Frontend->>SmartContract: Call getPremiumTokenCount()
        SmartContract->>Frontend: Return statistics
        Frontend->>User: Display reward statistics
    end